{"duration_api_ms":197774,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"b68a7982-fc20-48d7-a6f5-5745e4eb90e6","total_cost_usd":0.251598,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15411,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":18995,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":13586},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15411,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":18995,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15411},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":18995,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15411,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.251598,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":13586,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"All 17 front points lie on one curve at the geometric corner d≈3.38, b≈1.25, cone=70, and differ only in flight-path angle. Along that curve q rises from 240k to 291 kW/m2 and T falls from 421 to 393 K as gamma steepens from -1.5 to -3.59. The steepest usable gamma is set by max_g<=12. The only remaining slack is at the two corner limits: heatshield mass margin (d) and buildable geometry (b). Both are nearly exhausted, so I expect small gains from shifting the whole curve down and left, not a new regime.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-610c90e81316 through C-a985e3df7a53: all front members share d=3.38, b=1.25, cone=70. q and T move smoothly with gamma, and max_g reaches 11.985 (margin 0.0012) at gamma=-3.59.\",\"Mass margin is 0.004613 at d=3.38 and 0.001666 at d=3.385 (C-72dd5c8e34bb), a slope of about -0.59 per m. That matches margin ~ 1-c*d^2, so d is capped near 3.388.\",\"C-3e61663a34d3 (b=1.26) has margin 0.004924 versus 0.004613 at b=1.25, and q is 282960 versus 283380 at gamma=-3.3 (C-fe378e1d3bfd). Higher b therefore helps mass margin, q and slightly T.\",\"C-2317645f3652 and C-eb482c547f73 fail geometry at b=1.3 and 1.35, d=3.36, cone=70, with fore-cone lengths of -12.7 mm and -33.7 mm. Linear extrapolation puts the buildable limit near b≈1.27, so b=1.266 to 1.269 sits just inside it.\",\"C-bd7e4639d608 (cone 69.5, b=1.2, d=3.4) has q and T consistent with the d and b trends alone, so cone angle has almost no effect on q or T. It mainly affects mass margin and geometry, which favours cone=70.\",\"g rises by about 1.65 per deg of gamma and by about +0.002 per +0.005 m of d (C-e8cf251744f0 vs C-a7f55fea99fe), so gamma must stay at or above about -3.596 when d is 3.3875 to 3.388.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Peak deceleration is set mainly by entry angle, so max_g caps gamma near -3.6. Heat flux falls with nose radius (b*d) and with d, which lowers the ballistic coefficient and heat load. Bondline temperature falls with steeper gamma, larger d and slightly larger b. Heatshield mass fraction scales with d^2 and improves with a blunter, larger-cone shape, so the optimum is d≈3.388, b at its buildable maximum (about 1.267), and cone=70. I fitted local sensitivities from the data: q about -0.21% per +0.005 m of d, q about -0.15% per +0.01 of b, and T about -0.09 K per +0.005 m of d. These give a whole-curve shift of about -0.55% in q and -0.2 K in T. I sweep gamma at the improved (d, b) to replace the front members.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The b limit of about 1.27 is extrapolated from two failures at d=3.36, so 1.266 to 1.269 may fail geometry; proposal 16 (b=1.269) is the riskiest. The d and b sensitivities come from very small differences, so the predicted shifts are uncertain to about 50%. Points with gamma near -3.595 have only about 0.004 of g margin and could tip infeasible if the d-dependence of g is stronger than fitted. I am relying on local trends and have no data on other regions of the design space, although the earlier off-corner designs are all clearly dominated.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-610c90e81316\",\"rationale\":\"Low-q end of the front at the improved corner (d=3.3875, b=1.266).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":420.57,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the fitted d and b sensitivities at a low-risk gamma and extends the front's low-q end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ef73610dd6b8\",\"rationale\":\"Shift the front at gamma=-1.6 using the larger d and b.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":241300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":418.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the front at the improved corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6644df5ac78f\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-1.85.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.85},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement with slightly better q and T than the existing neighbours.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-df737e23a37f\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-2.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Mid-front point at the improved corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a708631e3a6a\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-2.4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259450,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.8,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Mid-front point at the improved corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-7a42d9b2504a\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Mid-front point at the improved corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d6f59a05633b\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-2.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.3,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Mid-front point at the improved corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-72dd5c8e34bb\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.0 (parent has d=3.385, b=1.25).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.25,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks that mass margin stays positive at d=3.3875 with b=1.266.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-f28cc7d64819\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":279300,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement in the g-limited region.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-fe378e1d3bfd\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":283100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement near the high-gamma end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6f66fc14536a\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.45.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":285600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.35,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement near the g limit; predicted g is about 11.77, feasible.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-e8cf251744f0\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.52.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":287350,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement near the g limit; predicted g is about 11.87.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-cb4f7a3f0bb6\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.56.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.56},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.25,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Approaches the g limit; predicted g is about 11.94.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a985e3df7a53\",\"rationale\":\"Improved-corner point at gamma=-3.58.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":288850,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.05,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Approaches the g limit; predicted g is about 11.97.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a985e3df7a53\",\"rationale\":\"Steepest allowed gamma at the improved corner. Predicted g is about 11.996, just under 12.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.595},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":289200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Lowest-T end of the front. It tests how much g margin remains with the larger d.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6f66fc14536a\",\"rationale\":\"Probe the geometry limit with b=1.269. The fitted limit is about 1.2695. A success gives a small extra q reduction.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3875,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.269,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":284200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.85,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the buildable bluntness boundary, which sets the bound for later rounds. A geometry failure is informative.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-a985e3df7a53\",\"rationale\":\"Push d to 3.388 with b=1.267 at gamma=-3.594. Mass margin is estimated at about +0.0004 and g at about 11.995.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.388,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.267,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.594},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":289040,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.91,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the joint d and b limit for the lowest-T corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-fe378e1d3bfd\",\"rationale\":\"d=3.388 and b=1.266 at gamma=-3.3, to separate the d effect from the b effect.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.388,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":281730,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the mass-margin cap at d=3.388 and the sensitivities.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6d99358fc11d\",\"rationale\":\"d=3.388 and b=1.266 at gamma=-2.0 to check the sensitivities on the shallow side.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.388,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement and a check that the sensitivities are independent of gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-d2d4cf811aa2\",\"rationale\":\"d=3.388 and b=1.266 at gamma=-2.9 for another front replacement.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.388,\"bluntness_ratio\":1.266,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":271700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.4,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front replacement and a further check of the mass-margin cap at d=3.388.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":156002,"type":"result","duration_ms":197850,"uuid":"53f2800e-109b-449a-a201-b0c8f61aad2a","ttft_stream_ms":1366,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":1366,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
